---
<section class="programs" id="program">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header fade-up">
      <span class="subtitle">Program & Event</span>
      <h2>Pilih Jalur <span class="text-gradient">Belajarmu</span></h2>
      <p>Dari program rutin hingga event spesial, kami menyediakan lingkungan belajar yang inklusif untuk semua usia.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- Card 1: Main Event (Large) -->
      <div class="bento-item event-card fade-up" style="grid-area: event; animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <!-- Area Foto Flyer (Siap diganti dengan gambar) -->
        <div class="event-flyer">
          <img src="/image.png" alt="Ramadan Intensive Flyer" class="flyer-img" />
          <div class="flyer-overlay"></div>
          <div class="event-badge">ONGOING EVENT</div>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-content event-content-padded">
          <div class="card-icon event-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"></path><line x1="4" y1="22" x2="4" y2="15"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Ramadan Quran Intensive</h3>
          <p>Tingkatkan kualitas bacaan dan hapalan Al-Qur'an selama bulan suci dengan bimbingan asatidzah berkompeten.</p>
          <div class="event-meta">
            <span class="meta-item"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg> 1 - 20 Ramadan</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20mendaftar%20program%20bimbingan%20Al-Qur%27an%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="btn-event">Ikuti Event</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card-bg-decoration"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Program Rutin 1 -->
      <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20mendaftar%20program%20bimbingan%20Al-Qur%27an%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="bento-item program-card fade-up" style="grid-area: p1; animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H2z"></path><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h6z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Tahsin & Tajwid</h3>
        <p>Perbaiki makhraj dan hukum bacaan agar sesuai dengan kaidah yang benar.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <div class="tag">Program Rutin</div>
          <span class="btn-text">Daftar <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 3: Program Rutin 2 -->
      <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20mendaftar%20program%20bimbingan%20Al-Qur%27an%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="bento-item program-card fade-up" style="grid-area: p2; animation-delay: 0.3s;">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z"></path><path d="M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Tahfidz Al-Quran</h3>
        <p>Program menghafal Al-Qur'an dengan metode muraja'ah terukur.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <div class="tag">Program Rutin</div>
          <span class="btn-text">Daftar <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 4: Stats/Info (Wide) -->
      <div class="bento-item info-card fade-up" style="grid-area: info; animation-delay: 0.4s;">
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-stat">
            <span class="stat-num">500+</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Alumni</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-stat">
            <span class="stat-num">15+</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Asatidzah</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-stat">
            <span class="stat-num">4.9/5</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Rating</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Program Rutin 3 -->
      <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20mendaftar%20program%20bimbingan%20Al-Qur%27an%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="bento-item program-card fade-up" style="grid-area: p3; animation-delay: 0.5s;">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Tahseena Kids</h3>
        <p>Belajar mengaji interaktif untuk anak & remaja secara menyenangkan.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <div class="tag">Kids Class</div>
          <span class="btn-text">Daftar <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 6: Program Rutin 4 -->
      <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20mendaftar%20program%20bimbingan%20Al-Qur%27an%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="bento-item program-card fade-up" style="grid-area: p4; animation-delay: 0.6s;">
        <div class="card-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Tahseena Private</h3>
        <p>Belajar Al-Qur'an lebih personal dengan jadwal fleksibel.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <div class="tag">Private</div>
          <span class="btn-text">Daftar <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 7: CTA (Medium) -->
      <div class="bento-item cta-card fade-up" style="grid-area: cta; animation-delay: 0.7s;">
        <h3>Kurikulum Custom?</h3>
        <p>Tanyakan kebutuhan belajarmu langsung kepada Admin kami.</p>
        <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Admin%2C%20saya%20ingin%20bertanya%20seputar%20pembelajaran%20di%20Tahseena." target="_blank" class="btn-ghost-white">Tanya Admin</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .programs {
    padding: 120px 0;
    transition: background 0.3s;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: transparent !important;
    font-family: var(--font-main);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 70px auto;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main) !important;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .text-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--primary-cyan));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: var(--text-light) !important;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr;
    grid-auto-rows: minmax(220px, auto);
    grid-template-areas: 
      "event p1 p2"
      "event p3 p4"
      "cta info info";
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .bento-item {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 32px;
    padding: 35px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), translate 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.4s ease, border-color 0.4s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    z-index: 2;
    will-change: transform, translate, box-shadow;
  }

  .bento-item:hover {
    translate: 0 -10px;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.2);
    border-color: var(--primary-blue);
    z-index: 10;
  }

  /* Specific Card Treatments */
  .event-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #1e40af 100%) !important;
    color: white !important;
    padding: 0 !important; /* Removed to let flyer touch edges */
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
  .event-card h3, .event-card p { color: white !important; margin-left: 0; }

  .event-flyer {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; /* Format Portrait Instagram */
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }

  .flyer-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.4) 0%, transparent 100%);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  :global(.flyer-img) {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 1;
    transition: transform 0.5s ease;
  }
  
  .event-card:hover .flyer-img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .event-content-padded {
    padding: 35px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1;
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
  }

  .event-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 25px; left: 25px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); /* Darker for better contrast against images */
    backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .event-icon {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: white;
    width: 60px; height: 60px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-event {
    background: white;
    color: #1e40af;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    width: fit-content;
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    transition: 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-event:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  /* Program Card */
  .program-card { 
    text-decoration: none; 
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .program-card h3 { 
    color: var(--text-main) !important; 
    font-size: 1.3rem; 
    margin-bottom: 12px; 
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .program-card p { 
    color: var(--text-light) !important; 
    font-size: 0.95rem; 
    line-height: 1.6; 
    margin-bottom: 25px; 
  }

  .card-icon {
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    background: rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.1);
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .card-footer {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: auto; padding-top: 15px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary-blue);
    background: rgba(40, 118, 180, 0.08);
    padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 50px;
  }

  .btn-text { 
    font-size: 0.85rem; 
    font-weight: 800; 
    color: white !important; 
    background: var(--primary-blue);
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    display: flex; 
    align-items: center; 
    gap: 8px;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .arrow {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  
  .program-card:hover .btn-text {
    background: var(--primary-cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(38, 198, 218, 0.4);
    padding-right: 22px; /* Expanding effect */
  }

  .program-card:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  /* Info & CTA */
  .info-card { 
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px dashed var(--card-border) !important; 
  }
  
  .info-grid {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .info-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .stat-num { font-size: 2.22rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--primary-blue); line-height: 1; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }

  .cta-card { 
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-blue), var(--accent-blue)) !important; 
    color: white !important; 
    text-align: center;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
  }
  
  .cta-card h3 { color: white !important; font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; }
  .cta-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9) !important; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 5px; }

  .btn-ghost-white {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: white !important; 
    padding: 12px 25px; 
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none; 
    font-weight: 700; 
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: 0.3s;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .btn-ghost-white:hover {
    background: white;
    color: var(--primary-blue) !important;
  }

  .card-bg-decoration {
    position: absolute; bottom: -20px; right: -20px;
    width: 140px; height: 140px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  .fade-up { opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards; }

  @media (max-width: 1200px) {
    .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-areas: "event event" "p1 p2" "p3 p4" "cta cta" "info info"; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-areas: "event" "p1" "p2" "p3" "p4" "cta" "info"; }
    .programs { padding: 80px 0; }
  }
</style>
